  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "41",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 41"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "41",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu yitutu mwenenu zo kumesu ami; nyuza yawantu yikwati Ŋovu jajiha. Enzi kwakwihi, ahoshi. Tukundamenu hamu, tusompi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinyi nasaŋumuni muntu kumusela, muntu atambikaŋa ayimukuloŋa enzi kumwendu windi? Wamwinkaŋa nyuza kukuyayi, wamuyulishaŋa anyanta. Wamukwashaŋa kuyitapa nampoku yindi yakabali neyi lunkuŋu, nikuyisowa nawuta windi wamukunji neyi ntotu jikuleloka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuyikupisha, hakupandakana kwindi wape-e; munjila yabulayi dehi kwenda nanyendu yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinyi nachikoŋa, achiila, hakutambika makiŋu awantu kufumisha kutachi? Yami Yehova, watachi, nidi nawakukuminina, diyi Ami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yitutu yamweni, yatiyili woma, insa jeseki jazaalili, jakunda mini kwakwihi, jenjili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwu hakukwasha mukwawu, iwu hakukwashamukwawu, iwu hakumwila mana kwindi, iwu hakumwila mana kwindi, nindi, Dikoleshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwakusoŋa nyitondu hakwinka muchi wawuru ŋovu, mukwakulambisha nahamala niyena nawa hakumwinka mukwakuchila namusensi ŋovu, hakutena aha hananuŋuwu nindi, Hanawahi. Hakuyihatishana mbwambu kulonda yibuli kunyinkesha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa eyi Isarela, eyi ŋamba yami, eyi Yakoba natondeli, eyi mukwamutaŋa webwambu dami Abarahama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeyi nafumishili kunsa jeseki, yeyi nawa natambikili kumbaŋu jadu, nakwilili nami, Yeyi ŋamba yami, nakutondi, hinakúumbuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wutiyaloŋa womaku, ami nidi neyi. Bayi wuyeŋashanaku, ami yami Nzambi yeyi, nakakwinkana Ŋovu; chalala nakakukwashaŋaku; chalala nakakukwataŋa chachiwahi nachikasa chami chachidiilu chakuloŋa kwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya, antu ejima adi nakuzuwa naneyi akatiya nsonyi, akabaya, alwishaŋa naneyi, akekala neyi hikudi nichumaku, akanoŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa atadekaŋa naneyi wakayikeŋakeŋa, hiwakayimonaku. Awa adasaŋa njita naneyi akekala neyi hikudi nichumaku, mwalala kwaamuneyi hikudi nichumaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa ami Yehova Nzambi yeyi nakakukwataŋa kuchikasa cheyi chachidiilu, nakakwilaŋa nami, Bayi wutiya womaku, nukukukwashaŋaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Eyi kabubu Yakoba, ninenu tuntu twamuIsarela, bayi mutiyaloŋa womaku; nakayikwashaku. Wajila waIsareladiyi nkúuli yeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyaku, nakakubalumuna wikali chuma chakuhulanachu chachiha, chatwa chi kweti maji. Wakahula mpidi jamaneni, wakajitwaleketi, mpidi janyanya wakajifukumuna neyi muzuŋu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakajipepa, akajitwala kudi mpepela, akajimwaŋa kudi chinjimbi mwa-mwa; wakazaŋalala naYehova, wakadisamba naWajila waIsarela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atuzweŋi nawabula yuma hiyakukeŋakeŋa meji, akakwosi, madimiawu hiyakuuma chau nampwila. Ami Yehova nakayakula, ami Nzambi yaIsarela hinakayishiyaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakajikula tuloŋa hayilundalunda yamukunkulu, nituseloki mukachi kayinekineki; isaŋa dawuma nakadibalu muna ŋiya dameji, iseki dawuma nakadibalumuna tuseloki twameji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwisaŋa dawuma nakatumbamu nyisida, nanyisamba, niyibubu, ninyitondu yamanji; mwikuna nakashamu nyinjunŋa, ninyitondu yasweja nyikabu, ninyitonduyawulelu hamu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kulonda akamoni, akeluki, akatoŋojoki chachiwahi, akashinshikili hamu, nawu, Chikasa chaYehova dichi chineli chumichi; Wajila waIsarela diyi naleŋi yumiyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Awulenu muloŋa wenu. Mwanta waYakoba nindi, Shimunenu yikuma yenu yamaneni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayishimuni, atuleji yuma yakamwekana, tulejenu yuma yakusambila chiyekala, kulonda tuyi toŋa ojo kicha chiwahi twiluki muyakakumina; mukunkulwayi tuleji yuma yakenza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimunenu yuma yakenza nkumininaku, kulonda twiluki netu, muyanzambi. Chalala, kumina dakwila chachiwahi hela kwila chatama, kulonda twakahayami, twakachimweni hamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, kumunafumi kwosi, nimudimu wenu wamukunkulwayi; niwayitondaŋa hichishimashi makwindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasaŋumuni muntu wumu wakukabeta kakuchimunswa; wenzadehi; muntu watambikaŋa ijina dami nafumi kwaselelaŋa itaŋwa; wakayilotokela atulamba neyi chachaakaŋawu maseki akusota nachu, neyi chadataŋawu iwumba kudi kaŋemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinyi nachishimuni kufumisha kutachi, kulondatwiluki? Hela kushimunaŋahu dehi, kulonda tuhoshi netu, Waloŋa? Mwalala, kwosi wudi nakushimunaku; mwalala, kwosi wudi nakulejaku, mwalala, kwosi wudi nakutiya mazu enuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yami nakasambila kwila Ziyona, nami, Talenu, talenu awa. Yami nakatemesha kuYerusalema muntu wakuyitwela nsaŋu yayiwahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinatalaŋa hinamonaŋa muntuku; mukachi kawu chinukuyiihula himudi muntu wakuyileja maana mwaka akaŋakuli izuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
